# Studio scene binaries (HDR / textures / models, ~114MB) + the sample render.
# Several Vercel routes import CODE from services/studio-render (art-recipe.mjs,
# art-render-validation.mjs, art-timeline.mjs), which makes Vercel trace the whole
# directory and pulled these into the function bundle — api/leadgen/prepare-brief
# hit 471MB against a 250MB limit. Only the Cloud Run render service reads these
# at runtime, and it deploys separately (this file does not affect that deploy).
services/studio-render/assets/
services/studio-render/service-render.webm
